4.2     2013-12-27

        Added header line option to sfcdump csv output.  Increased csv size
        to 800 characters. Windows version is 750.

        Increase satellite winds MXSATW_P to 120,000.

        Increased hydro station to 15,000.

        Increased mas surface station (MXSTA_P) TO 600,000.

        Increased MXDATA_P to 4*MXSTA_P

        Increased max surface variables to 380.

        Fixed NOAA-19 ID.

        Changed msfcsta.f to return the provider's source id number. 

        Added the following variables to the mesonet dataset.

        HEDLIT    Mobile Head Lights
        MOFRIC    Mobile Friction
        PCP10M    precip 10 min
        PCPET     precip end time
        PCPST     precip start time
        RDBIS     Surface Black Ice Signal
        RDCV2     Surface Conductivity V2
        RDSDP     Road Snow Depth
        RDSPDP    Road Snowpack Depth
        RDSS      Surface Salinity
        SFACR     Snowfall AccumRate
        TSUN24H   Total Sunshine 24hr
        VIBWD1    Vibrating wire depth  - 1
        VIBWD2    Vibrating wire depth  - 2
        VIBWD3    Vibrating wire depth  - 3
        VISSIT    VisibilitySituation
        WIPER     Mobile Wipers
        ICEPER1   Percent of ice cover on roadway
        ICETK     Thickness of the ice  
        PCPYN     Precipitation Yes No
        WATDP     Depth of the water from a user-defined point 

