3.0     2005-11-30
        
        Added SNOW dataset.

        Changed MXSFC_P from 100000 to 200000.

        Raised lower limit for saturation vapor pressure in m_eswinv.f
        to avoid Compaq compiler underflow error.

        Increased satraddump.f array station size to 80000 to match 
        madiscon setting.

        Changed double precision variables maximum size to the maximum 
        number of stations.

        Put several variables local to dataset initialization routines 
        into common memory space.

        Added a check for rounding to -90 degrees in the grid coordinate 
        conversion to cover the case of where a latitude *not quite*
        -90 degrees caused a divide by zero with the Sun compiler.

        Changed raob_variable_list.txt to indicate that the PWIND variable
        may now include a mix of data created via log(P) interpolation and
        observed pressures, which are now available from MADIS.  Previously,
        only the interpolated values had been available.

